# 🧩 Sprint 1: Project Setup  
## HOPE INC. Customer Management System

---

## 📌 Overview  
This sprint focuses on setting up the base project and preparing the system for development.

---

## ⚙️ 1. Project Setup  
The project was initialized using modern web tools:

- React (Vite)
- Tailwind CSS
- React Router DOM
- Supabase

All required dependencies were installed using `npm install`.

---

## 🧭 2. Routing Setup  
React Router DOM was used to handle page navigation.

Pages include:
- Dashboard
- Customers
- Products
- Sales
- Login / Register
- Reports

---

## 🔐 3. Supabase Setup  
Supabase was added as the backend service.

- Connected using `.env` file
- Prepared for authentication and database features

---

## 🎨 4. UI Setup  
Basic layout structure was created using:

- Sidebar
- Navbar
- Main content area

This ensures a consistent design across pages.

---

## 🧪 5. Output of Sprint 1  
At the end of Sprint 1:

- Project runs using Vite
- Navigation is working
- Basic UI layout is ready
- Supabase setup is prepared

---

## 🚧 6. Current Status  
- Backend features are not yet implemented  
- Some pages are still basic  
- More features will be added in the next sprints  

---

## 📌 Conclusion  
Sprint 1 successfully established the foundation of the system. The project is ready for further development.
